          "name": "Anonymous"
        },
        "reviewBody": "Mark Talley represented me and I couldn't have been more happy with my representation. He won my workers' comp case, the whole thing was a home run, and I got way more back in the settlement than I expected. I would recommend Davis and Sanchez to anyone needing representation.",
