          "name": "Ruben L."
        },
        "reviewBody": "After 22 years of dealing with Workers Comp of Ut, they decided they would try to deny me further treatment. Even though this was a complicated case, Jared and his wonderful staff took them on, and were able to resolve my issue successfully. Thank you!",
